  "description": "NetMetric.Timer provides core abstractions, adapters, and utilities for capturing high-performance timing metrics in .NET applications.\n\t\t\tIt includes low-allocation timing scopes, in-memory and caching sinks, dynamic service proxies, and helpers for measuring sync/async operations\n\t\t\tusing ITimerSink. Designed for observability and extensibility in performance-critical systems.",
